{"strongs": "H7973", "word": "שֶׁ֫לַח", "translit": "she.lach", "root": "שלג", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "missile, weapon, sprout", "definition": "I. שֶׁ֫לַח noun [masculine] missile, weapon, sprout (late); — absolute ׳ שׁ Joel 2:8 +, שָׁ֑לַח Neh 4:11 ; Job 33:18 , suffix שִׁלְחוֺ Neh 4:17 plural שְׁלָחִים 2Chr 23:10 , etc.; — 1. missile, weapon , Neh 4:11 and v. Neh 4:17 (where הַמַּיִם corrupt; read probably בִּימִינוֺ or בְּיָדוֺ ; see Ryle BeRy Berthol ), 2Chr 23:10 (distinguished from חֲנִית , מָנֵן ); collective 2Chr 32:5 and ׳ עָבַר בַּשׁ Job 33:18 ; Job 36:12 ( perish by or < rush upon [and perish]), Joel 2:8 (see בְּעַד ). 2. sprout, shoot (compare [ שְׁלוּחָה ], and √ Ps 80:12 ; Jer 17:8 ), שְׁלָחַיִךְ פַּרְדֵּס Song 4:13 (figurative; meaning ? Perles Anal. 63 proposes שְׁנֵי לְחָיָיִךְ thy two cheeks ); + probably Ezek 31:5 (read בִּשְׁלָחָיו Co Toy and others, or בְּשִׁלְחֵי [with v Ezek 31:6 ] Krae ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8707')\">BDB8707</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7973')\">H7973</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8706')\">BDB8706</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8708')\">BDB8708</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>שֶׁ֫לַח</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>missile, weapon, sprout</highlightword> (late); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 2:8\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,8)\">Joel 2:8</ref> +, <bdbheb>שָׁ֑לַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,11)\">Neh 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 33:18\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,18)\">Job 33:18</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>שִׁלְחוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,17)\">Neh 4:17</ref> plural <bdbheb>שְׁלָחִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=